"""
CulturalConnect Architecture Overview

Tech Stack:
- Frontend: React.js (TypeScript), Material-UI, React Router, Axios, Socket.IO Client
- Backend: Node.js + Express.js
- Database: MongoDB (with Mongoose ODM)
- Real-time: Socket.IO (Node.js server + client)
- Deployment: Docker + Kubernetes on Google Cloud Platform (GCP)
- CI/CD: GitHub Actions

Key Modules:
1. User Authentication (JWT-based, OAuth2 optional)
2. Content Management (CRUD for literature, music, visual arts, films)
3. Recommendation Engine (collaborative + content-based filtering)
4. Real-time Chat (WebSocket via Socket.IO)
5. Responsive & Accessible UI (WCAG 2.1 AA compliant)

Database Schema Highlights:
- User: { _id, name, email, passwordHash, preferences: ["genre", "region"], interactions: [{contentId, type, timestamp}] }
- Content: { _id, title, type, creator, region, year, description, tags, mediaUrl, externalRefId }
- Interaction: { userId, contentId, type: 'view'|'like'|'comment'|'share', timestamp }
- ChatMessage: { roomId, senderId, text, timestamp, read: boolean }

External Integrations:
- Wikimedia Commons API (images)
- Spotify/YouTube APIs (media previews)
- Library of Congress / UNESCO APIs (educational facts)
"""


